{"seq":3,"slug":"hmm-in-practice","title":"落地与边界：库、选状态数、以及何时别用 HMM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/practice/hmm-in-practice","wordCount":1625,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"落地与边界-库-选状态数-以及何时别用-hmm\">落地与边界：库、选状态数、以及何时别用 HMM</h1><p>理论走通、变体选定、应用场景清楚之后，还剩最实际的三件事：用什么库把它跑起来？状态数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 这个必须人定的超参数怎么选？以及——在 Transformer 满天飞的 2026 年——什么时候 HMM 是对的选择，什么时候该老实换成别的模型？这一篇给出工程决策，也给出 HMM 诚实的能力边界。一个好的建模者，既知道它能做什么，更知道它做不了什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>库选型</strong>：hmmlearn 轻量专用、内部走对数域处理下溢，适合快速验证；pomegranate 以 PyTorch 为后端支持 GPU 与自动微分，适合大状态空间；生信直接上 HMMER。</li>\n<li><strong>状态数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：HMM 唯一必须人工指定又无标准答案的超参数，用带复杂度惩罚的 AIC/BIC 或留出似然选择，不能直接用训练似然（它随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 单调上升）。</li>\n<li><strong>三个结构性弱点</strong>：一阶马尔可夫记忆太短、生成式 + 输出独立用不了重叠特征、隐状态离散且需预设数目。</li>\n<li><strong>能力边界与首选场景</strong>：触到上述任一弱点就该换模型；小数据、要解释、算力紧、需精确推断时 HMM 仍是首选。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"用哪个库\">用哪个库</h2><p>Python 生态里 HMM 有两个主力库，定位不同。<strong>hmmlearn</strong> 是 scikit-learn 风格的专用库，API 简单（<code>GaussianHMM</code>、<code>CategoricalHMM</code>、<code>GMMHMM</code> 等），内部走对数域实现自动处理<a href=\"../learning/initialization-scaling\">数值下溢</a>。据 2026 年 7 月查证，它最新版本为 0.3.3，且处于「有限维护」状态——过去一年没有新版本发布到 PyPI，功能稳定但不再快速演进。<strong>pomegranate</strong> 定位更广，是通用概率建模库；其 v1.0.0 起底层重写为 PyTorch 后端，支持 GPU 与自动微分，HMM 拆成 <code>DenseHMM</code>（稠密转移矩阵，用矩阵乘）与 <code>SparseHMM</code>（稀疏转移，省内存）两种实现。下表帮你选。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>后端</th>\n<th>HMM 类</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>hmmlearn</td>\n<td>专用、轻量</td>\n<td>NumPy/Cython</td>\n<td>Gaussian/Categorical/GMM HMM</td>\n<td>快速上手、标准 HMM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pomegranate</td>\n<td>通用概率建模</td>\n<td>PyTorch</td>\n<td>DenseHMM / SparseHMM</td>\n<td>GPU、大状态空间、组合模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMMER</td>\n<td>生信专用</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>profile HMM</td>\n<td>蛋白/DNA 家族（见<a href=\"hmm-applications\">应用</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见的正确姿势：先用 hmmlearn 快速验证建模思路是否成立，确认有价值后，若遇到状态空间大或要 GPU 加速，再迁到 pomegranate。生信序列则直接上 HMMER，不必自己造轮子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选状态数-n-模型选择\">选状态数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>：模型选择</h2><p>状态数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是 HMM 唯一必须人工指定、又没有标准答案的超参数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 太小欠拟合（一个状态被迫解释本该分开的多种模式），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 太大过拟合（状态多到只记住噪声，且<a href=\"../inference/forward-backward\">似然</a>必然随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 单调上升，不能直接拿它选）。标准做法是用带复杂度惩罚的信息准则。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为收敛对数似然、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为自由参数个数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为观测总数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AIC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>BIC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AIC} = -2\\hat\\ell + 2k, \\qquad \\text{BIC} = -2\\hat\\ell + k\\log n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AIC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0412em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BIC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0412em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对一系列候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 各训练一个模型（每个都要多次<a href=\"../learning/initialization-scaling\">重启</a>取最优），算 AIC/BIC，选最小者。BIC 惩罚更重（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log n &gt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 通常成立），倾向更少状态、更适合追求可解释性；AIC 倾向更多状态、更适合追求预测。若状态有明确物理意义（音素数、市场 regime 数），直接按领域知识定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 比盲搜更靠谱。也可用留出集上的预测似然做交叉验证。下图是完整落地流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[准备序列数据] --&gt; B[对每个候选 N]&#10;    B --&gt; C[多次随机重启&lt;br/&gt;跑 Baum-Welch]&#10;    C --&gt; D[取最高似然模型]&#10;    D --&gt; E[算 AIC / BIC / 留出似然]&#10;    E --&gt; F{还有候选 N}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| B&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[选准则最优的 N]&#10;    G --&gt; H[在全量数据重训&lt;br/&gt;Viterbi 解码交付]\">graph TD\n    A[准备序列数据] --&gt; B[对每个候选 N]\n    B --&gt; C[多次随机重启&lt;br/&gt;跑 Baum-Welch]\n    C --&gt; D[取最高似然模型]\n    D --&gt; E[算 AIC / BIC / 留出似然]\n    E --&gt; F{还有候选 N}\n    F --&gt;|是| B\n    F --&gt;|否| G[选准则最优的 N]\n    G --&gt; H[在全量数据重训&lt;br/&gt;Viterbi 解码交付]</pre><h2 id=\"何时别用-hmm-诚实的边界\">何时别用 HMM：诚实的边界</h2><p>这是全篇最有价值的部分。HMM 有三个结构性弱点，触到任何一个就该考虑替代。</p>\n<p><strong>弱点一：一阶马尔可夫记忆太短</strong>。当前状态之外的历史被完全丢弃，长程依赖建模不了。语言里「他昨天说……所以今天……」这种跨句依赖，HMM 无能为力——这正是 <a href=\"../../time-series-analysis/ts-models/arima-models\">RNN/LSTM</a> 和 Transformer 的地盘，它们的隐向量能携带任意长历史。</p>\n<p><strong>弱点二：生成式 + 输出独立，用不了重叠特征</strong>。HMM 建模观测如何生成，要求发射相互独立。可序列标注里，一个词的标签常依赖大量重叠特征（前缀、后缀、是否大写、上下文词），这些特征彼此不独立，HMM 塞不进去。判别式的**条件随机场（CRF）**直接建 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Q\\mid O)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，天然容纳任意重叠特征，在命名实体识别等任务上系统性地优于 HMM。这也是为什么 NLP 的序列标注早已从 HMM 迁到 CRF 再迁到 BiLSTM-CRF。</p>\n<p><strong>弱点三：隐状态离散且需预设数目</strong>。状态连续（如平滑运动轨迹）时应换<a href=\"../../time-series-analysis/ts-models/arima-models\">卡尔曼滤波/线性动态系统</a>；状态数目未知且想让数据自己决定时，应换<strong>无限 HMM（HDP-HMM）</strong>，用<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/models/hierarchical-models\">贝叶斯非参数</a>让状态数随数据增长。</p>\n<p>那 HMM 什么时候仍是<strong>首选</strong>？搜索结果给出的 2026 共识很清晰：数据量小、要求可解释、算力受限、需要精确推断的场景。它有精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 推断、参数少不易过拟合、隐状态直接对应可解释的物理概念、训练快。生信里 profile HMM 依旧一线，正因为它同时满足这几条。下表是最终决策速查。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>该换成</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需要长程依赖</td>\n<td>RNN / LSTM / Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>要用重叠/上下文特征做标注</td>\n<td>CRF / BiLSTM-CRF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐状态是连续量</td>\n<td>卡尔曼滤波 / 线性动态系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态数未知、想数据自定</td>\n<td>HDP-HMM（贝叶斯非参数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小数据 + 要解释 + 算力紧</td>\n<td>就用 HMM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>库选型：hmmlearn（0.3.3，有限维护，轻量上手）快速验证，pomegranate（PyTorch 后端，Dense/Sparse）上规模/GPU，生信用 HMMER。</li>\n<li>状态数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 用 AIC/BIC 或留出似然选，不能用训练似然（随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 单调升）；有物理意义就按领域定。</li>\n<li>三个结构弱点：短记忆（换 RNN/Transformer）、输出独立用不了重叠特征（换 CRF）、离散预设状态（换卡尔曼或 HDP-HMM）。</li>\n<li>HMM 首选场景：小数据、要解释、算力紧、要精确推断——2026 年它依旧不可替代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>库要处理的数值问题：<a href=\"../learning/initialization-scaling\">初始化与数值缩放</a></li>\n<li>选状态数依赖的似然：<a href=\"../inference/forward-backward\">前向后向算法</a></li>\n<li>交付时的解码：<a href=\"../inference/viterbi\">Viterbi 解码</a></li>\n<li>状态数自定的贝叶斯思路：<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/models/hierarchical-models\">分层模型</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：hmmlearn 0.3.3（PyPI，2026-07 查证，有限维护）；pomegranate v1.0.0 文档（DenseHMM/SparseHMM，PyTorch 后端）；ScienceDirect 2025 生信综述关于 HMM 适用边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"落地与边界：库、选状态数、以及何时别用 HMM","id":"落地与边界-库-选状态数-以及何时别用-hmm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用哪个库","id":"用哪个库"},{"level":2,"text":"选状态数 N：模型选择","id":"选状态数-n-模型选择"},{"level":2,"text":"何时别用 HMM：诚实的边界","id":"何时别用-hmm-诚实的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"应用：语音识别与生物信息学两大主场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/practice/hmm-applications"},"next":null}